sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Review inbox query and response
  accDescr: The server checks the session and installation, validates filters, reads a bounded summary page, and projects safe fields. Denied access clears private rows, invalid filters return a bad request, and temporary failures preserve the last good page.
  autonumber
  participant UI as Browser inbox
  participant API as GET /api/reviews
  participant Auth as Session boundary
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Map as Projection

  UI->>API: Filters + opaque cursor, session cookie
  API->>Auth: Require live OAuth configuration
  Auth->>DB: Session hash, expiry and installation membership
  DB-->>Auth: Current numeric identity and role
  alt Missing or revoked access
    Auth-->>API: 401 or 403
    API-->>UI: Access denied, no query results
    UI->>UI: Clear private rows<br/>Restore sign-in
  else Authorized
    Auth-->>API: Trusted installation ID
    API->>API: Validate filters and cursor<br/>Keep fixed ordering
    alt Invalid query
      API-->>UI: 400, no result query
    else Valid query
      API->>DB: Tenant scope + keyset, take 21<br/>Summaries + shared-review projection
      alt Database unavailable or deadline exceeded
        DB-->>API: Query failure
        API-->>UI: Sanitized 503, no demo fallback
        UI->>UI: Keep last good page<br/>with its applied filters
      else Query succeeds
        DB-->>API: At most 21 rows
        API->>Map: First 20, cursor from last returned row
        Map-->>API: Counts, outcomes, owner, short note<br/>No source excerpt or sandbox output
        API-->>UI: 200 + no-store + nextCursor
        UI->>UI: Validate live response<br/>Replace snapshot<br/>Ignore stale requests
      end
    end
  end
